WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.400
Your agent works.

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:04.700
It isn't a product yet.

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:07.200
That half is the same in every AI SaaS.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:13.200
Intelligo ships that half. One command.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:25.200
Every page lands as your own source.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:30.000
A running product. Day one.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Your agent runs unmodified.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Every run, accounted for.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Make it yours — config, not forks.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:00.000
You build the agent. Intelligo is everything around it.
